                                        "entry_id": "bc8da7bf-7904-3450-a2fe-90b2909dec3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A supporter of Wesleyanism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed4f18d0-6af2-419e-994e-2ac040833c62",
                                                "sense_id": "aaf8d1c0-4a60-396e-8e32-27e674f54929",
                                                "text": "However, after breakfast the prayings did not stop for the preachings, — each went on with force; people came flocking in; we had Wesleyans in abundance."
